  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 103.02 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 310-A:29, I the board shall consist of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:29, I, II or both.\n\nSource. #3029, eff 5-28-85; ss by #4599, eff 4-13-89, EXPIRED: 4-13-95\n\nNew. #6136, eff 12-1-95; ss by #7942, eff 8-27-03",
